{"4120050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Guidu", "steam_appid": 4120050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is there life after death? Would you go to Naraka or Yondu? No matter, you are in Guidu now. The residents seems to have their own way of greeting you and you shall reciprocate their welcome appropriately. Despite this, there seems to be a strange but familiar essence emanating from this place. Keeping what little humanity that still lingers and even allowing you to regain some lost memories of who you used to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guidu is a squad based cooperative wave defense third person shooter. Set in a ghostly 1900's inspired atmosphere.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or with 4 other lost souls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a map and defend against waves of progressively stronger enemy hordes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold objectives to receive skill shards that boost stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from 3 distinct Disciplines, each with their own unique abilities and weapon loadouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the ultimate boss.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is there life after death? Would you go to Naraka or Yondu? No matter, you are in Guidu now. The residents seems to have their own way of greeting you and you shall reciprocate their welcome appropriately. Despite this, there seems to be a strange but familiar essence emanating from this place. Keeping what little humanity that still lingers and even allowing you to regain some lost memories of who you used to be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guidu is a squad based cooperative wave defense third person shooter. Set in a ghostly 1900's inspired atmosphere.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or with 4 other lost souls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a map and defend against waves of progressively stronger enemy hordes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold objectives to receive skill shards that boost stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from 3 distinct Disciplines, each with their own unique abilities and weapon loadouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the ultimate boss.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Defend the city against hordes of restless hungry ghosts with 4 of your friends. Choose different classes and utilize different strategies. How long can you last?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120050/fe6162ee7778cac874081346703c1af51aef937c/header.jpg?t=1773938532", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120050/e8a931633d47b5108c3eca858db6416e05873c78/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773938532", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120050/e8a931633d47b5108c3eca858db6416e05873c78/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773938532", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD CPU at 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 or 12 compatible with 2 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Feleax Elegance Studios"], "publishers": ["Feleax Elegance Studios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 200, "final": 200, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$2.00"}, "packages": [1443718], "package_groups": [{"name": "defaul